1056:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_uart.c ****     This subsection provides a set of functions allowing to manage the UART asynchronous
1057:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_uart.c ****     and Half duplex data transfers.
