2727:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_uart.c ****                       ##### Peripheral Control functions #####
2728:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_uart.c ****  ===============================================================================
2729:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_uart.c ****     [..]
2730:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_uart.c ****     This subsection provides a set of functions allowing to control the UART.
2731:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_uart.c ****      (+) HAL_UART_ReceiverTimeout_Config() API allows to configure the receiver timeout value on th
2732:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_uart.c ****      (+) HAL_UART_EnableReceiverTimeout() API enables the receiver timeout feature
2733:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_uart.c ****      (+) HAL_UART_DisableReceiverTimeout() API disables the receiver timeout feature
2734:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_uart.c ****      (+) HAL_MultiProcessor_EnableMuteMode() API enables mute mode
2735:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_uart.c ****      (+) HAL_MultiProcessor_DisableMuteMode() API disables mute mode
2736:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_uart.c ****      (+) HAL_MultiProcessor_EnterMuteMode() API enters mute mode
2737:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_uart.c ****      (+) UART_SetConfig() API configures the UART peripheral
2738:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_uart.c ****      (+) UART_AdvFeatureConfig() API optionally configures the UART advanced features
2739:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_uart.c ****      (+) UART_CheckIdleState() API ensures that TEACK and/or REACK are set after initialization
2740:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_uart.c ****      (+) HAL_HalfDuplex_EnableTransmitter() API disables receiver and enables transmitter
2741:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_uart.c ****      (+) HAL_HalfDuplex_EnableReceiver() API disables transmitter and enables receiver
2742:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_uart.c ****      (+) HAL_LIN_SendBreak() API transmits the break characters
2743:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_uart.c **** @endverbatim
