2748:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_uart.c ****   * @brief  Update on the fly the receiver timeout value in RTOR register.
2749:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_uart.c ****   * @param  huart Pointer to a UART_HandleTypeDef structure that contains
2750:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_uart.c ****   *                    the configuration information for the specified UART module.
2751:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_uart.c ****   * @param  TimeoutValue receiver timeout value in number of baud blocks. The timeout
2752:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_uart.c ****   *                     value must be less or equal to 0x0FFFFFFFF.
2753:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_uart.c ****   * @retval None
